{"version":1,"content":"<p>38歲匡智會男助理舍監2024年在殘疾人士院舍五度強姦一名輕度智障女學員，在本周三判刑獲判監禁13年，案件由舍監翻查閉路電視紀錄揭發。</p><p>社會福利署今回覆本報指，絕不容忍傷害殘疾人士的行為，並表示已加強對院舍翻看閉路電視系統的要求。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T11:39:59.193807+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:00:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T10:57:39.517689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:37:39.934563+00:00","content_hash":"a6c0461a6e7bdefe09f9ac0423e90a9b8ad754b440829fa59967f24032a17889","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}